{"3964140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SUSHI Claw Machine", "steam_appid": 3964140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim, Grab, and Send 'Em Flying!  Take control of a physics-based mechanical claw to grab and toss sushi at will—or entirely by accident! Experience the hilarious unpredictability of physics as you &quot;skillfully&quot; fling your favorite dishes to secure your score.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/e72db98ed0f3e47b00bf6f082d090383.poster.avif?t=1784546482\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/e72db98ed0f3e47b00bf6f082d090383.webm?t=1784546482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/e72db98ed0f3e47b00bf6f082d090383.mp4?t=1784546482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill the Encyclopedia of Weird Sushi From groovy, dancing Salmon and exploding Tuna to Shiny Egg and Ginger that races backward on the belt, collect every bizarre dish that makes your stomach growl. Can you catch them all and become the ultimate Sushi Master?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/5190c6d38bd6fdbf7bc4acccac7ea256.poster.avif?t=1784546482\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/5190c6d38bd6fdbf7bc4acccac7ea256.webm?t=1784546482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/5190c6d38bd6fdbf7bc4acccac7ea256.mp4?t=1784546482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Chaotic Events Expect the unexpected with a variety of chaotic events that demand a reaction. Watch the crane grow to a gargantuan size or survive an all-out sushi stampede! Dive into a world of conveyor belt sushi comedy driven by pure physics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/8bc9588deb65df79155504abe0768b3f.poster.avif?t=1784546482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/8bc9588deb65df79155504abe0768b3f.webm?t=1784546482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/8bc9588deb65df79155504abe0768b3f.mp4?t=1784546482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:  Physics-based Comedy, Casual Simulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines: We warmly welcome both individuals and corporations to stream and post videos of this game.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No prior notice is required.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monetization using platform features is fully permitted.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We kindly ask that you include the game title, &quot;Sushi Claw Machine,&quot; and the link to the Steam store page in your video description.</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 